### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 1. Take Screenshot
POST http://localhost:3000/api/screenshot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "fullPage": true,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080
}

### 1b. Debug Screenshot (returns screenshot + debug info)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/debug-screenshot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.google.com",
  "fullPage": false,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "timeout": 120000
}

### 2. Navigate to URL
POST http://localhost:3000/api/navigate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "waitUntil": "networkidle2"
}

### 3. Click Element by Text
POST http://localhost:3000/api/click-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "text": "More information",
  "elementType": "a"
}

### 4. Click Element by Selector
POST http://localhost:3000/api/click-selector
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "selector": "a[href]",
  "waitForNavigation": false
}

### 5. Fill Form
POST http://localhost:3000/api/fill-form
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.google.com",
  "fields": [
    {
      "selector": "textarea[name='q']",
      "value": "puppeteer automation",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Get Page Content
POST http://localhost:3000/api/content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "selector": "h1"
}

### 7. Execute Custom Script
POST http://localhost:3000/api/execute-script
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "script": "return { title: document.title, links: document.querySelectorAll('a').length }"
}

### 8. Wait for Element
POST http://localhost:3000/api/wait-element
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "selector": "h1",
  "timeout": 30000
}

### 9. Get Element Attributes
POST http://localhost:3000/api/element-attributes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "selector": "h1"
}

### 10. Scroll Page
POST http://localhost:3000/api/scroll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "direction": "bottom"
}

### 11. Generate PDF
POST http://localhost:3000/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "format": "A4",
  "landscape": false
}

### 12. Type Text
POST http://localhost:3000/api/type
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.google.com",
  "selector": "textarea[name='q']",
  "text": "hello world",
  "delay": 100
}

### ===== GOOGLE EXAMPLES (Stealth Mode) =====

### Google Search - Type Query
POST http://localhost:3000/api/type
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.google.com",
  "selector": "textarea[name='q']",
  "text": "puppeteer automation",
  "delay": 100
}

### Google Search - Get Results
POST http://localhost:3000/api/execute-script
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.google.com/search?q=puppeteer",
  "script": "return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('h3')).map(h => h.textContent).filter(t => t)"
}

### Google - Take Screenshot
POST http://localhost:3000/api/screenshot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.google.com",
  "fullPage": false,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "timeout": 120000
}

### Google - Navigate and Get Title
POST http://localhost:3000/api/navigate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.google.com",
  "waitUntil": "networkidle2"
}
